---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What GrowthPeak Digital collects when you use this site or request a free audit, how we use it, and how to ask us to change or delete it."
  updated="October 16, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what {site.name} ("we", "us") collects when you visit this site or request a
    free audit, and what we do with it. It is short because we collect very little.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you request a free audit, you give us:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name and email address,</li>
    <li>your business name and website address, if you choose to add them.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Our hosting provider also keeps standard server logs, such as your IP address, browser type and
    the pages you requested, so the site can be delivered and kept secure. We do not use advertising
    or analytics trackers, and this site does not set cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use your details to prepare and send your audit, to reply to you, and to follow up about the
    audit and our services. We do not use them for anything unrelated to that.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>
    We share your details only with the providers that help us run the site and the business: our
    hosting provider, and the customer-management (CRM) system where we store the details you submit.
    They may use your information only to provide those services to us.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it for advertising. We may disclose
    it if the law requires us to.
  </p>

  <h2>Where it is handled</h2>
  <p>
    Our team works remotely, so your information may be accessed from outside the United States. The
    site and form use HTTPS, so what you submit is sent over an encrypted connection.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your details for as long as they are useful for the purposes above, unless you ask us to
    delete them sooner.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can email us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> to ask for a copy of your
    details, to correct them, to delete them, or to stop us contacting you. We respond to these
    requests promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is for business owners and is not directed to children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call
    <a href={`tel:${site.phone}`}> {site.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
